msgstr "NAME"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:7
msgid "git-version - Display version information about Git"
msgstr "git-version - Gitに関するバージョン情報を表示する"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:12
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "'git version' [--build-options]"
msgid "\t'git version' [--build-options]\n"
msgstr "'git version' [--build-options]"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:16
msgid ""
"With no options given, the version of 'git' is printed on the standard "
"output."
msgstr ""
"オプションが指定されていない場合、 `git` のバージョンが標準出力に出力されま"
"す。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Note that `git --version` is identical to `git version` because the former "
"is internally converted into the latter."
msgstr ""
"`git --version` は `git version` と同じであることに注意してください。これは、"
"前者が内部で後者に変換されるためです。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPTIONS"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--build-options`"
msgstr "`--build-options`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Include additional information about how git was built for diagnostic "
"purposes."
msgstr "診断目的でgitがどのように構築されたかに関する追加情報を含めます。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-version.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The libraries used to implement the SHA-1 and SHA-256 algorithms are "
"displayed in the form `SHA-1: <option>` and `SHA-256: <option>`. Note that "
"the SHA-1 options `SHA1_APPLE`, `SHA1_OPENSSL`, and `SHA1_BLK` do not use a "
"collision detection algorithm and thus may be vulnerable to known SHA-1 "
"collision attacks. When a faster SHA-1 implementation without collision "
"detection is used for only non-cryptographic purposes, the algorithm is "
"displayed in the form `non-collision-detecting-SHA-1: <option>`."
msgstr ""

